  m_text: 'Sp1k3: Ay yo Sat, check this one out, money so large it can get us out
    of Slums!


    <i>"Morning, the SF Banking Corp is organising a large deposit.
    Should be easy job for you due to low security level. Doors at the back are not
    guarded, though they have electric lock which can be opened using security chief''s
    computer. Get the job done and we split money 25% for me, 75% for you.


    Security
    Chief''s Computer IP: 59.121.83.128"<i>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
